# PROJECT: AI STUDY MATE
## Complete AI-Powered Personal Learning, Examination & Career Development Platform

Act as a senior product architect, UI/UX designer, Flutter developer, full-stack engineer, cloud engineer, database architect and AI engineer.

Your responsibility is to help me design and develop a complete, production-oriented application called **AI STUDY MATE**.

Do not treat this as an ordinary chatbot project.

I want to build a sophisticated AI-powered personal learning ecosystem that combines two intelligent systems:

1. AI EXAM TUTOR
2. AI CAREER COACH

Both systems must work together through a shared student profile, persistent memory, learning history and progress-tracking system.

The application must be developed with a premium visual identity, scalable architecture, secure backend and intelligent AI capabilities.

