## Progress calculation

Progress must be calculated using actual database records.

Basic formula:

Progress Percentage =
(Completed Tasks / Total Planned Tasks) × 100

For more advanced progress, introduce weighted completion.

Projects and assessments may carry more weight than simply reading a lesson.

Maintain separate measurements for:

COMPLETION:
How much of the learning roadmap has been completed?

MASTERY:
How well does the student understand the material?

Do not confuse activity completion with actual skill mastery.

The AI must never invent progress percentages.

Every chart must reflect actual recorded activities.

